Bind Npc 14406 Zone 2
Quest 204 "Hornet Hunt"
    Journal "[Imperial Guard] Telson has commissioned you to hunt Hornet."
    Kill 30 of 4401, 4451 at direction_27

Requires player level >= 47 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 4000000 experience

direction_27 = location "Hornet" about "Hornet\nReferred to as Hell`s Bees; inhabits plains; powerful venom can kill humans with one sting" found "El Morad" karus at 1383 1110 elmorad at 607 991 in zone 2
direction_31 = location "[Imperial Palace Guard] Telson" about "[Imperial Palace Guard] Telson\nJack-of-all-trades who takes care of everything for the Imperial Palace " found "El Morad Castle" at 1673 315 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
    Topic "Where is he/she?" do
        Map direction_31

On offer
    Say "Ha ha~ I guess it reached your ears as well. Yes, it is true. This time I am going to hunt the Hornets, so do you want to join me?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You may be able to gain valuable experience from this hunt. Why don't you and your colleagues come join us?\n\nIf you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Telson, you will be rewarded with experience points."

On claimable
    Show quest "Haha... how is it going? Good work."
